  "plain": "The TR3B, a secret triangular aircraft rumoured to exist, was built under a program led by three US spy agencies: the National Reconnaissance Office, which runs spy satellites, the CIA, and the NSA, which handles electronic eavesdropping. That is what a man named Edgar Fouche said, as relayed by a researcher who goes by the online name UAPGerb. If true, it would mean spy agencies rather than the regular military ran the most secret aircraft work."
}
